      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do you think we could instead keep passing `NULL` (avoiding needing to manage the struct on the heap and reducing the amount of work libavb needs to do), as we only seem to use `out_data` to locate the VBMeta, which we\u0027ll need to do manually for `Payload` to support `get_`/`read_partition(\"vbmeta\")` once stop using `NO_VBMETA_PARTITION`.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 438,
        "startChar": 16,
        "endLine": 438,
        "endChar": 24
      },
      "revId": "d12aed6b1db02c7cbead781ca8876c11fe24fd18",
