      "lineNbr": 438,
      "author": {
        "id": 1958315
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-01-12T10:29:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That is one option and that\u0027ll make `verify_vbmeta` more independent. But it also requires more work as we cannot get vbmeta directly, we\u0027ll first need to read (and validate) the footer, then read the vbmeta_offset/size from the footer to get the vbmeta, or maybe still validate it before reading its descriptors. It is more or less what [libs/vbmeta](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:packages/modules/Virtualization/libs/vbmeta/src/lib.rs;l\u003d89;drc\u003ddc63fe0be17bafdb4ebd08c88000fc81dfa26f2b) tries to do.\n\nIn comparison, what we get from `out_data` is directly a verified vbmeta, so we don\u0027t need to go through all the trouble to locate and validate it before reading.",
      "parentUuid": "c562ec27_34fcb66f",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 438,
        "startChar": 16,
        "endLine": 438,
        "endChar": 24
      },
      "revId": "d12aed6b1db02c7cbead781ca8876c11fe24fd18",
