      "message": "I guess the only condition that matters is if `initrd \u003d\u003d None` but we have a initrd hash (meaning that the owner expected the kernel to be booted with a disk). Otherwise, I don\u0027t see why a VBMeta without `initrd_debug` wouldn\u0027t be valid, for example.",
